        "action_desc": "Introduced in House",
        "text": "<p><strong>Mobile Post Office Relief Act</strong></p><p>This bill requires the U.S. Postal Service, under specified circumstances, to provide certain postal services by way of a vehicle or mobile facility when an existing postal retail facility is temporarily not providing such services.&nbsp;</p>",
